cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its outputs, please cite it as below, together with the upstream data, code and model credits listed in README.md (Credits)."
title: "vesuvius-ink-maps: registered ink maps for the public PHerc. 0800 / PHerc. 1447 segments, a low-VRAM surface_m7 runner, and an ink-inference benchmark"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "vesuvius-ink-maps contributors"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-11-02"
repository-code: "{REPO_URL}"
abstract: "Ink maps (reader-v2 and Hecate, forward and reverse) for all 21 public segments of PHerc. 0800 and PHerc. 1447 as VC3D-loadable OME-Zarr, a 1.6 GiB-VRAM runner for the surface_m7 nnU-Net surface model, and a measured benchmark of villa flat ink inference. Built on Vesuvius Challenge open data (CC BY-NC 4.0), ScrollPrize/villa (MIT), reader-v2 (MIT), Hecate (MIT) and surface_m7_nnunet (Apache-2.0)."
